{"text": " You wake up today, your phones charged, the lights come on, and somewhere a field of solar panels has been awake since sunrise. Did you know that in 2025, solar power made almost 11 times more electricity than it did 10 years earlier? That's almost 9% of all the world's electricity. The international energy agency has said the best solar projects offer some of the cheapest electricity ever seen. So what's the sun to you now? Power, something you harvest like a crop. And in December 2024, NASA's Parker Solar Probe flew through the sun's outer atmosphere faster than anything humans have ever built. And yet you spend most of your day indoors behind screens and windows. We've touched the sun, we plug into it. So why have you still never seen it as it is today?", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.22, "text": " You wake up today, your phones charged,", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 965, 11, 428, 10216, 11109, 11, 50498], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337830134800502, "compression_ratio": 1.5932203389830508, "no_speech_prob": 0.03152098134160042, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.5789603590965271}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9725629091262817}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.42, "probability": 0.9982256293296814}, {"word": " today,", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.7, "probability": 0.9927120208740234}, {"word": " your", "start": 1.26, "end": 1.4, "probability": 0.9863643050193787}, {"word": " phones", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.7, "probability": 0.6212509870529175}, {"word": " charged,", "start": 1.7, "end": 2.22, "probability": 0.9580039381980896}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.68, "end": 3.42, "text": " the lights come on,", "tokens": [50498, 264, 5811, 808, 322, 11, 50570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337830134800502, "compression_ratio": 1.5932203389830508, "no_speech_prob": 0.03152098134160042, "words": [{"word": " the", "start": 2.68, "e